2026-11-28T15:56:12.2685234Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_FORMAT" "$INPUT_FORMAT" "table"[0m
2026-11-28T15:56:12.2685654Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_TEMPLATE" "$INPUT_TEMPLATE" ""[0m
